cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyRadMC in work you publish, please cite it as below."
title: pyRadMC
abstract: >-
  A fast, permissively licensed photon Monte Carlo dose engine for radiotherapy treatment
  planning. Its primary product is a beamlet-resolved dose influence matrix (Dij),
  computed on CPU and CUDA from a single physics source, with condensed-history electron
  transport and Woodcock delta tracking for photons.
type: software
